<p>Zalzalo me dunya thi aasmaan larza tha<br />
reg-e garm senra par shaahedee'n ka lasha tha</p>

<p>Be qaraar moujei'n thee'n Shola baar darya tha<br />
Ibne saaqie kousar teen din ka pyasa tha</p>

<p>Har qadam pa thokar thi dil me dard uth'ta tha<br />
Sheh ki naatawani thi noujawaa'n ka lasha tha</p>

<p>Kal lahu me doobegi noujawaani akber ki<br />
Maa ki chashme hasrat thi sub'ha ka sannata tha</p>

<p>Qatl ho gaye abbas aas tooti pyaso'n ki<br />
Mashk tukde tukde thi Khoo'n me tar pharera tha</p>

<p>Qalbe fouj me utthi inqelaab ki moujei'n<br />
Daste shah par pyaasa sheerqaar bacha tha</p>

<p>Ab wo chaand bano ka zere qaak pohnchaa hai<br />
Ghar ki jo tajalli thi aankho'n ka ujaala tha<br />
</p>